      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Chosen edges (red): ab, cd, ef - no two share an endpoint, so M is a matching, |M| = 3\nAlgorithm returns both endpoints of each chosen edge: C = {a,b,c,d,e,f}, |C| = 6\nAny cover needs one vertex per matching edge, so OPT >= 3 (e.g. {b,d,e}); 6 <= 2 x OPT",
      "originalText": "Chosen edges (red): ab, cd, ef - no two share an endpoint, so M is a matching, |M| = 3\nAlgorithm returns both endpoints of each chosen edge: C = {a,b,c,d,e,f}, |C| = 6\nAny cover needs one vertex per matching edge, so OPT >= 3 (e.g. {b,d,e}); 6 <= 2 x OPT",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ch13-02-vertex-cover-2-approx-n6",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14
